{"faciltList":[{"faciltId":"H100V06096","faciltCateKindCd":"03","faciltName":"와일드 사바나 익스페디션","faciltNameEng":"Wild Savanna Expedition","faciltDescrt":"차창 밖 구경은 끝났다!\n다년간의 노하우로 완성한\n압도적 길이의 초근접 사바나 탐험\n'와일드 사바나 익스페디션' \n\n기나긴 폭염에 지친 여러분을 위한\n잃어버린 활력을 되찾아줄 최고의 장소!!\n\n사바나 물줄기를 따라\n기린과 코끼리, 사자까지 생생하게 마주하는 순간!\n아프리카 사바나 한가운데 들어온 듯한\n압도적인 스케일 속\n동물들의 생생한 숨소리까지!\n\n온 가족이 함께 떠날 경이로운 야생 탐험\n전면 무료 개방!\n\n올 가을, 더 가까이, 더 오랫동안!\n선선한 바람이 부는 로스트밸리에서\n물윗길을 함께 걸으며\n여러분의 탐험 본능을 깨워보세요!\n\n[기간]\n2026년 9월 12일(토)\n~ 2026년 11월 30일(월)\n\n[장소] 로스트밸리","faciltDescrtEng":"The moment you step out of the vehicle,\nThe real expedition begins!\n\nThe ultimate choice to make up for the spring you missed!\n‘Wild Savanna Expedition’\n\nCloser, longer, and more immersive!\nThe moment to awaken the explorer's DNA within you.\n\nFeel the vibrant life right beneath your feet.\nAs you walk on water and drift with the wind in Lost Valley,\nCome and experience the true breath of the wild!\n\n[Period]\nSeptember 12, 2026 (Sat)\n~ November 30, 2026 (Mon)\n\n[Location] Lost Valley","openTime":"0930","closeTime":"1700","operStatusCd":"OPEN","waitDescCd":"","waitDescText":"","vlineWaitYn":"N","vlineWaitGrpCd":"","lastOrderTime":"","zoneKindCd":"06","exposrOrder":"9999","guardRidingYn":"Y","keywordDescrt":"와일드 사바나 익스페디션#도보탐험#로스트밸리","keywordDescrtEng":"Wild Savanna Expedition##","heightLimitStartRange":"","heightLimitEndRange":"","weightLimitRange":"","reservYn":"","reservConnUrl":"","foodTypeCds":"","useCondDescrt":"","useCondDescrtEng":"","thumbImagUrl":"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/facilities/a5fc2f97d217459191e60138b7de71ae.jpg","perfrmPlayMm":"","chhdCompanReservUrl":"","expedncyFaciltKindCd":"","flowCtrlUseYn":"N","flowCtrlGateId":"","vlineAbleYn":"N","offlineWaitYn":"Y","offlineWaitConvTime":"","waitTime":10,"waitLvl":"","operSort":"1","sort":10,"giftcardYn":"N","mobileOrderYn":"N","somYn":"N","perfrmSort":"10000","faciltPlayList":[],"locLength":0.0,"locList":[{"latud":"37.2917777","lgtud":"127.205442","x":"-1","y":"-1","insideYn":"N","insideFloor":"0"}],"animalPlayYn":"N","rentYn":"N","rentStatus":"","disabledRsvAble":"N"},{"faciltId":"H100V06003","faciltCateKindCd":"03","faciltName":"사파리월드 : 더 와일드","faciltNameEng":"Safari World :The Wild","faciltDescrt":"야생 시작의 장소,\n야생의 자연에서 영감을 받은 새로운 사파리 입니다.\n자연에 더 가깝게,\n더 풍부한 자연 환경을 위해 새롭게 조성되었습니다.\n\n[다크 나이트 사파리 안내]\n낮보다 짜릿한 밤의 탐험!\n낮에는 볼 수 없던 맹수들의 또 다른 모습!\n사파리 야간 개장을 함께 즐겨보아요!\n\n※ 운영 기간 \n9.12 ~ 11.15 (금~일, 공휴일)\n※ 운영 시간\n- (9.12~10.11) 18:00 ~ 20:00\n- (10.16~11.15) 17:30 ~ 19:30\n※ 무료입장관람","faciltDescrtEng":"The Place of Wild Beginnings\nA new safari inspired by the raw beauty of wild nature.\nNewly designed to bring you closer to nature and offer a richer, more authentic natural environment.\n\n[Dark Night Safari ]\nAn expedition in the dark, even more thrilling than the day!\nWitness a completely different side of wild beasts that you can't see during the daytime!\nCome and enjoy the special night opening of the safari!\n● Operating Period\nSeptember 12 ~ November 15 (Fridays to Sundays, and Public Holidays)\n● Operating Hours\nSept 12 ~ Oct 11: 18:00 ~ 20:00 (6:00 PM ~ 8:00 PM)\nOct 16 ~ Nov 15: 17:30 ~ 19:30 (5:30 PM ~ 7:30 PM)\n● Admission\nFree Admission & Viewing","openTime":"0950","closeTime":"1700","operStatusCd":"OPEN","waitDescCd":"","waitDescText":"","vlineWaitYn":"N","vlineWaitGrpCd":"A","lastOrderTime":"","zoneKindCd":"06","exposrOrder":"9995","guardRidingYn":"Y","keywordDescrt":"사파리월드#더와일드#사자#호랑이#곰","keywordDescrtEng":"Safari World#The Wild#Lion#Tiger#Bear","heightLimitStartRange":"100","heightLimitEndRange":"","weightLimitRange":"0","reservYn":"N","reservConnUrl":"","foodTypeCds":"","useCondDescrt":"~100cm 보호자동반 필요","useCondDescrtEng":"~100cm guardian required","thumbImagUrl":"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/facilities/41dbae351eed47f2a8fb85dcc4f092e3.png","perfrmPlayMm":"","chhdCompanReservUrl":"","expedncyFaciltKindCd":"","flowCtrlUseYn":"Y","flowCtrlGateId":"701","vlineAbleYn":"N","offlineW