ou a new look with cute charms\nFriendly Ranch\nCome meet some lovely animals!\n\nOn the green Fantastic Wings lawn \nBlack sheep and alpacas are here!","openTime":"1000","closeTime":"1700","operStatusCd":"OPEN","waitDescCd":"","waitDescText":"","vlineWaitYn":"N","vlineWaitGrpCd":"","lastOrderTime":"","zoneKindCd":"06","exposrOrder":"999","guardRidingYn":"","keywordDescrt":"알파카#프렌들리랜치#흑비양","keywordDescrtEng":"##","heightLimitStartRange":"","heightLimitEndRange":"","weightLimitRange":"","reservYn":"","reservConnUrl":"","foodTypeCds":"","useCondDescrt":"","useCondDescrtEng":"","thumbImagUrl":"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/facilities/161803dad5c540b59780074570507654.jpg","perfrmPlayMm":"","chhdCompanReservUrl":"","expedncyFaciltKindCd":"","flowCtrlUseYn":"N","flowCtrlGateId":"","vlineAbleYn":"N","offlineWaitYn":"N","offlineWaitConvTime":"","waitTime":"","waitLvl":"","operSort":"1","sort":"0","giftcardYn":"N","mobileOrderYn":"N","somYn":"N","perfrmSort":"10000","faciltPlayList":[],"locLength":0.0,"locList":[{"latud":"37.292324","lgtud":"127.205246","x":"-1","y":"-1","insideYn":"N","insideFloor":"0"}],"animalPlayYn":"N","rentYn":"N","rentStatus":"","disabledRsvAble":"N"},{"faciltId":"H100V06002","faciltCateKindCd":"03","faciltName":"판다월드","faciltNameEng":"Panda World","faciltDescrt":"[ 판다월드 관람 안내 ]\n\"판다월드는 10/1(목)부터 \n회차당 10분 제한 관람으로 운영됩니다.\n현장 상황에 따라 쾌적한 관람 환경 조성을 위해\n관람 시간이 일부 조정 될 수 있습니다.\"\n\n동물들의 생태 환경과 유사하게\n자연친화적으로 조성된 공간에\n러바오와 아이바오가 살고 있는 판다월드!\n\n사랑스러운 패밀리가 보여주는 마법 같은 이야기를\n인터랙티브 매직쇼와 함께 판다지아에서 체험해 보세요!\n\n평일, 주말 구분 없이\n실내 방사장과 야외 방사장을\n10분 제한 관람으로 운영합니다.\n\n* 실내+실외 제한 관람(평일/주말 공통)\n* 동물의 컨디션에 따라 방사 일정은 변경될 수 있습니다.\n\n관람 시 소음이 발생하지 않도록 관람 에티켓 준수 부탁드립니다.","faciltDescrtEng":"Panda World, where the Bao family lives in a<br>\nnatural environment similar to their own Panda World,<br>\nwhere the Bao family lives!<br>\nExperience the magical story of<br>\nthis adorable family with the interactive magic show!!!<br>","openTime":"1000","closeTime":"1730","operStatusCd":"OPEN","waitDescCd":"","waitDescText":"","vlineWaitYn":"N","vlineWaitGrpCd":"A","lastOrderTime":"","zoneKindCd":"06","exposrOrder":"794","guardRidingYn":"Y","keywordDescrt":"자이언트판다 #레서판다 #황금원숭이 #러바오 #아이바오","keywordDescrtEng":"pandaworld #babypanda #Bao Family","heightLimitStartRange":"","heightLimitEndRange":"","weightLimitRange":"0","reservYn":"N","reservConnUrl":"","foodTypeCds":"","useCondDescrt":"","useCondDescrtEng":"","thumbImagUrl":"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/facilities/38d942a2e978496ea4bd56fe2b27e8d5.png","perfrmPlayMm":"","chhdCompanReservUrl":"","expedncyFaciltKindCd":"","flowCtrlUseYn":"Y","flowCtrlGateId":"704","vlineAbleYn":"N","offlineWaitYn":"Y","offlineWaitConvTime":"1400","waitTime":20,"waitLvl":"","operSort":"1","sort":20,"giftcardYn":"N","mobileOrderYn":"N","somYn":"N","perfrmSort":"10000","faciltPlayList":[],"locLength":0.0,"locList":[{"latud":"37.29313","lgtud":"127.20307","x":"-1","y":"-1","insideYn":"N","insideFloor":"0"}],"animalPlayYn":"N","rentYn":"N","rentStatus":"","disabledRsvAble":"N"},{"faciltId":"H100V06085","faciltCateKindCd":"03","faciltName":"씨라이언 빌리지","faciltNameEng":"Sea Lion Village!","faciltDescrt":"깊은 물속을 헤엄치기도 하고\n바위 위에서 쉬기도 하는\n바다사자, 물개, 물범들의 평화로운 쉼터\n씨라이언 빌리지!\n\n매 시간마다 바뀌는 해양동물 친구들! \n지금 이순간, 어떤 동물이 헤엄치며 놀고 있을까요?\n주키퍼가 들려주는 생생한 동물이야기!\n\n정각이 되면, 새로운 해양동물을 만나볼 수 있습니다.\n주키퍼의 전문적인 설명으로 동물에게 숨겨진 비밀을 알아가고,\n맛있게 간식을 즐기는 모습으로 함께 즐거움을 느껴보세요\n매 시간마다 다른 해양동물들이 헤엄치고 놀고 있답니다.\n\n* 운영 시간 내 자유롭게 관람이 가능하나, \n당일 방문객 현황에 따라 현장운영 방법이 \n변경 될 수 있습니다.","faciltDescrtEng":"I swim deep in the water\nand rest on the rocks\na peaceful shelter for sea lions, seals and seals\nSea Lion Village!\n\nPlease come and visit our new animal friends appearing every hour, \nalong with animal talks from expert zookeepers and snacks! . \nDifferent marine animals will be here every hour! \nIt will be a surprise for you since different marine animals \nwill be showing up every time. \nYou will be able to enjoy this special time with the new animal, zoo keeper, \nwhich is very rare. \nEach hour, you can meet a new marine animal. \nLearn the animals' hidden secrets with the zookeepers' expert explanations, and join in the fun as you enjoy a delicious snack. Different marine animals swim and watch them play every hour.\n\n* You can watch it freely during operating hours.","openTime":"1100","closeTime":"1630","operStatusCd":"OPEN","waitDescCd":"","waitDescText":"","vlineWaitYn":"N","vlineWaitGrpCd":"","lastOrderTime":"","zoneKindCd":"06","exposrOrder":"790","guardRidingYn":"","keywordDescrt":"바다사자#물개#물범","keywordDescrtEng":"sealion#sea lion#seal","heightLimitStartRange":"","heightLimitEndRange":"","weightLimitRange":"","reservYn":"","reservConnUrl":"","foodTypeCds":"","useCondDescrt":"","useCondDescrtEng":"","thumbImagUrl":"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/facilities/ee941aa2bf3741bb8538d12457ab3960.jpg","perfrmPlayMm":"","chhdCompanReservUrl":"","expedncyFaciltKindCd":"","flowCtrlUseYn":"N","flowCtrlGateId":"","vlineAbleYn":"N","offlineWaitYn":"N","offlineWaitConvTime":"","waitTime":"","waitLvl":"","operSort":"1","sort":"0","giftcardYn":"N","mobileOrderYn":"N","somYn":"N","perfrmSort":"10000","faciltPlayList":[],"locLength":0.0,"locList":[{"latud":"37.29257729","lgtud":"127.2050000","x":"-1","y":"-1","insideYn":"N","insideFloor":"0"}],"animalPlayYn":"N","rentYn":"N","rentStatus":"","disabledRsvAble":"N"},{"faciltId":"H100V01052","faciltCateKindCd":"03","faciltName":"바오 하우스","faciltNameEng":"Bao Haus","faciltDescrt":"바오패밀리의 스토리가 담겨 있는 곳!\n\n푸바오와 루이&후이를 키우며 \n육아고수로 거듭난,\n아이바오의 좌충우돌 육아일기!\n\n바오패밀리의 행복한 기억들을 만나보세요.\n\n\n* 바오 하우스 영상은 <img src=\"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/suneditor/image/20240214/b7fe0fd158ab4ff6b5b656bfc036b0e9.jpg\" alt=\"Panasonic\" style=\"height: 14px; vertical-align: middle;\"> 프로젝터로 상영됩니다.\nTogether with <img src=\"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/suneditor/image/20240214/b7fe0fd158ab4ff6b5b656bfc036b0e9.jpg\" alt=\"Panasonic\" style=\"height: 14px; vertical-align: middle;\">","faciltDescrtEng":"The place that contains the story of the Bao family!\n\nThank you","openTime":"1100","closeTime":"1730","operStatusCd":"OPEN","waitDescCd":"","waitDescText":"","vlineWaitYn":"N","vlineWaitGrpCd":"A","lastOrderTime":"","zoneKindCd":"01","exposrOrder":"774","guardRidingYn":"","keywordDescrt":"바오패밀리#아이바오#아기판다#바오하우스","keywordDescrtEng":"Bao family#Aibao#baby panda#baohaus","heightLimitStartRange":"","heightLimitEndRange":"","weightLimitRange":"","reservYn":"","reservConnUrl":"","foodTypeCds":"","useCondDescrt":"","useCondDescrtEng":"","thumbImagUrl":"https://www.everland.com/contents/ia/facilities/780f496f50eb4409b9d6a15b2b649771.jpg","perfrmPlayMm":"","chhdCompanReservUrl":"","expedncyFaciltKindCd":"","flowCtrlUseYn":"Y","flowCtrlGateId":"703","vlineAbleYn":"N","offlineWaitYn":"N","offlineWaitConvTime":"","waitTime":"","waitLvl":"","operSort":"1","sort":"0","giftcardYn":"N","mobileOrderYn":"N","somYn":"N","perfrmSort":"10000","faciltPlayList":[],"locLength":0.0,"locList":[{"latud":"37.29396020","lgtud":"127.2024887","x":"-1","y":"-1","insideYn":"N","insideFloor":"0"}],"animalPlayYn":"N","rentYn":"N","rentStatus":"","disabledRsvAble":"N"},{"faciltId":"H100V06021","faciltCateKindCd":"03","faciltName":"타이거밸리","faciltNameEng":"Tiger Valley","faciltDescrt":"국내에서 가장 가까운 거리에서 한국호랑이를 만나볼 수 있는 곳!\n타이거밸리가 시원한 폭포와 연못, 자작나무 숲으로\n백두대간 한국호랑이의 서식지를 재현했어요.\n한국의 기상이 살아있는 멋진 한국 호랑이를 만나보세요!\n \n※ 동물의 건강 및 기상 상황에 따라 방사 시간이 변경될 수 있으며 방사되지 않을 수 있습니다.","faciltDescrtEng":"The closest place to see the Korean tiger in Korea!\nTiger Valley has recreated the habitat of the Baekdudaegan Korean tiger with cool waterfalls, ponds, and birch forests. habitat of the Korean tiger.\nSee the Korean tiger in all its glory!\n\n* Exhibit times are subject to change and may not be displayed depending on animal health and weather conditions.","openTime":"1000","closeTime":"1700","operStatusCd":"OPEN","waitDescCd":"","waitDescText":"","vlineWaitYn":"N","vlineWaitGrpCd":"","lastOrderTime":"